// Why: std.gpu.vk calls Vulkan 1.3 and WSI entry points through typed
// instance and device dispatch tables without hardcoding signatures.
//
// What: GlobalDispatch, InstanceDispatch, DeviceDispatch, and their
// vkGetInstanceProcAddr / vkGetDeviceProcAddr loaders. Generated by
// tools/vkdispatch from Khronos registry/vk.xml; do not edit by hand.
//
// How: each field uses c.vulkan's PFN_vk* type; required core entries
// fail loading when null, while extension entries depend on flags.

import c.vulkan
